  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : 320 × 8 - 216 + 72 ÷ 5 = 184 \n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : + and ×​\n\nGiven statement : 320 × 8 - 216 + 72 ÷ 5 = 184 \n\nAfter interchanging\n\n320 + 8 - 216 × **72 ÷ 5**__ = 184\n\n320 + 8 - __**216 **____**× 14.4**__ = 184\n\n__**320 + 8**__ - 3110.4 = 184\n\n__**328 - 3110.4**__ = 184\n\n-2782.4 ≠ 184 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : - and ÷\n\nGiven statement : 320 × 8 - 216 + 72 ÷ 5 = 184 \n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n320 × **8 ÷ 216**__ + 72 - 5 = 184\n\n__**320 × 0.37**__ + 72 - 5 = 184\n\n__**118.4 + 72**__ - 5 = 184\n\n__**190.4 - 5**__ = 184\n\n-185.4 ≠ 184 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : ÷ and +\n\nGiven statement : 320 × 8 - 216 + 72 ÷ 5 = 184 \n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n320 × 8 - **216 ÷ 72**__ + 5 = 184\n\n__**320 × 8**__ - 3 = 184\n\n__**2560 - 3**__ = 184\n\n2554 ≠ 184 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : × and ÷\n\nGiven statement : 320 × 8 - 216 + 72 ÷ 5 = 184 \n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n**320 ÷ 8**__ - 216 + 72 × 5 = 184\n\n40 - 216 + __**72 **____**×**____** 5**__ = 184\n\n__**40 + 360**__ - 216 = 184\n\n__**400 - 216**__ = 184\n\n184 = 184 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (4)\" is the correct answer.",
